-- Quantitative Aptitude - Arithmetic
('UPSC EPFO', 'Quantitative Aptitude and Reasoning', 'Quantitative Aptitude - Arithmetic', 'medium', 'mcq',
 'If the simple interest on a sum for 2 years at 5% per annum is Rs. 100, find the principal.',
 '[{"text":"Rs. 500","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Rs. 1000","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Rs. 2000","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Rs. 1500","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
 null, 'Using SI = P*R*T/100, P = SI*100/(R*T) = 100*100/(5*2) = 1000.'),
('UPSC EPFO', 'Quantitative Aptitude and Reasoning', 'Quantitative Aptitude - Arithmetic', 'easy', 'mcq',
 'A shopkeeper sells an item at a 20% profit. If the cost price is Rs. 500, find the selling price.',
 '[{"text":"Rs. 550","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Rs. 600","isCorrect":true},{"text":"Rs. 620","isCorrect":false},{"text":"Rs. 700","isCorrect":false}]'::jsonb,
 null, 'Selling price = Cost price + 20% of cost price = 500 + 100 = 600.'),
('UPSC EPFO', 'Quantitative Aptitude and Reasoning', 'Quantitative Aptitude - Arithmetic', 'easy', 'mcq',
